OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F336A1786105098
OL,3,CRiot prisoner took own life after
OL,4,Cbeing reported for racism
OL,6,FA man who was jailed following a riot
OL,7,Foutside an asylum seekers' hotel took
OL,8,Fhis own life two days after being
OL,9,Freported to the prison governor for
OL,10,Falleged racism, a jury has found.
OL,12,FPeter Lynch, 61, was one of 120 people
OL,13,Fsentenced after violence outside the
OL,14,FHoliday Inn Express in Manvers,
OL,15,FRotherham, in August 2024.
OL,17,FHe was jailed for two years and eight
OL,18,Fmonths by a judge who heard how he was
OL,19,Fat the front of a mob that gathered
OL,20,Foutside the hotel shouting "scum" and
OL,21,F"child killers" at riot police.
OL,26,@|D@\OU|D@aO]}D@AOU}D@OO]
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G1/12
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,337,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33602
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F336A1786105098
OL,3,CRiot prisoner took own life after
OL,4,Cbeing reported for racism
OL,6,FHe was found dead in his cell at HMP
OL,7,FMoorland, near Doncaster, on 19
OL,8,FOctober 2024.
OL,10,FA two-and-a-half-week-long inquest
OL,11,Fheard how Lynch had been reported for
OL,12,Falleged racist comments two days
OL,13,Fbefore his death and was waiting for
OL,14,Fan adjudication by a prison governor.
OL,16,FOn Wednesday, an inquest jury returned
OL,17,Fa conclusion of suicide on the
OL,18,Fdirections of a coroner.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G2/12
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,337,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F336A1786105098
OL,3,CRiot prisoner took own life after
OL,4,Cbeing reported for racism
OL,6,FIn its formal conclusion, the jury
OL,7,Fsaid: "The information provided
OL,8,Fverbally to Mr Lynch prior to the
OL,9,Fadjudication papers being served,
OL,10,Fregarding the adjudication process,
OL,11,Fwas sufficient.
OL,13,F"Following the adjudication papers
OL,14,Fbeing served, and Mr Lynch's own
OL,15,Fbelief that he was defenceless, could
OL,16,Fnot protect his family, the children
OL,17,For the people, led Mr Lynch to take
OL,18,Fthe action that he did."
OL,26,@oD@GOUuD@AOUzD@XO]
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G3/12
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,337,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F336A1786105098
OL,3,CRiot prisoner took own life after
OL,4,Cbeing reported for racism
OL,6,FSumming up the case on Wednesday
OL,7,Fmorning, senior Doncaster coroner
OL,8,FNicola Mundy said officers told the
OL,9,Fcourt how they had been taking the
OL,10,Fprisoner to a random drugs test on 17
OL,11,FOctober when he began to express his
OL,12,Fview on immigration and asylum seekers
OL,13,Fand the events outside the hotel.
OL,15,FShe said the officers reported that he
OL,16,Fsaid that "they're all rapists and
OL,17,Fpaedophiles and should not be allowed
OL,18,Fin the country".
OL,26,@xD@KOUzD@OO]
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G4/12
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,337,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33605
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F336A1786105098
OL,3,CRiot prisoner took own life after
OL,4,Cbeing reported for racism
OL,6,FThe officers said they asked him to
OL,7,Fstop making the comments because they
OL,8,Ffound them "disrespectful, abusive and
OL,9,Fracist", but he persisted.
OL,11,FMs Mundy told jurors it was not a
OL,12,Fmatter for them to determine "whether
OL,13,Fthe words expressed by Mr Lynch were
OL,14,Fracist" but reminded them that: "Mr
OL,15,FLynch did not agree with the officers'
OL,16,Fassessment that the comments made were
OL,17,Fracist."
OL,26,@pD@LOUqD@GO]tD@^OUvD@GO]vD@aOUyD@HO]
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G5/12
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,337,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33606
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F336A1786105098
OL,3,CRiot prisoner took own life after
OL,4,Cbeing reported for racism
OL,6,FThe coroner said the court had seen
OL,7,FCCTV of Mr Lynch "going about his
OL,8,Fbusiness" on 18 October before he went
OL,9,Finto his cell at 4.29pm, which was
OL,10,Flater locked.
OL,12,FHe made a series of calls, chatting to
OL,13,Fhis family, and was later visited by a
OL,14,Fmember of prison staff who gave him
OL,15,Fthe adjudication papers through a
OL,16,Fcrack in the door just after 7pm,
OL,17,Fexplaining that he was due to see the
OL,18,Fgovernor about the matter in the
OL,19,Fmorning.
OL,26,@oD@ROUpD@IO]
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G6/12
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,337,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33607
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F336A1786105098
OL,3,CRiot prisoner took own life after
OL,4,Cbeing reported for racism
OL,6,FA prison officer raised the alarm at
OL,7,Froll-call the next morning, and Mr
OL,8,FLynch's body was found in his cell at
OL,9,F6.29am.
OL,11,FHe died from hanging, the jury found.
OL,13,FMr Lynch was arrested on 4 August 2024
OL,14,Foutside the hotel, where he was
OL,15,Fphotographed holding a placard
OL,16,Fasserting the corruption of MPs,
OL,17,Fjudges, the media and the police.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G7/12
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,337,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33608
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F336A1786105098
OL,3,CRiot prisoner took own life after
OL,4,Cbeing reported for racism
OL,6,FHe was filmed repeatedly challenging
OL,7,Friot police as they tried to push him
OL,8,Fback with shields, screaming "protect
OL,9,Fmy children" and yelling: "We are on
OL,10,Fthe streets now to protect our kids."
OL,12,FJudge Jeremy Richardson KC told him at
OL,13,Fthe sentencing hearing: "You did not
OL,14,Fyourself attack any police officer, as
OL,15,Ffar as can be detected, but what you
OL,16,Fdid was encourage by your conduct
OL,17,Fothers to behave violently and you
OL,18,Fwere part of this mob."
OL,26,@pD@^OUqD@LO]qD@[OUrD@eO]uD@YOUzD@WO]
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G8/12
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,337,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33609
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F336A1786105098
OL,3,CRiot prisoner took own life after
OL,4,Cbeing reported for racism
OL,6,FThe violence at the Holiday Inn left
OL,7,F64 police officers injured, as well as
OL,8,Ffour dogs and a horse, and was one of
OL,9,Fa series of violent incidents in the
OL,10,Fwake of the murder of three young
OL,11,Fgirls in Southport.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G9/12
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,337,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33610
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F336A1786105098
OL,3,CRiot prisoner took own life after
OL,4,Cbeing reported for racism
OL,6,FThe inquest at Doncaster Coroner's
OL,7,FCourt heard how officers and staff
OL,8,Ffrom a Sheffield police station, at
OL,9,FHMP Doncaster, and at HMP Moorlands
OL,10,Fhad no concerns raised about any
OL,11,Fmental health problem, despite Mr
OL,12,FLynch's son Lewis ` who was in
OL,13,FDoncaster prison at the same time for
OL,14,Fhis involvement in the Manvers
OL,15,Fdisorder ` saying an inmate told him
OL,16,Fabout suicide attempts by his father
OL,17,Fwhich he reported.
OL,19,FThe coroner said she was concerned
OL,20,Fabout two aspects of the case which
OL,21,Fhad since been addressed by the prison.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1        G10/12
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,337,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33611
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F336A1786105098
OL,3,CRiot prisoner took own life after
OL,4,Cbeing reported for racism
OL,6,FMs Mundy said one of those was about
OL,7,Fthe amount of information provided to
OL,8,Fprisoners about being reported for
OL,9,Fadjudication before they are locked
OL,10,Fdown.
OL,12,FShe said the prison had told her this
OL,13,Fissue has already been addressed with
OL,14,Fa system that now provides follow-up
OL,15,Fengagement and assessment.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1        G11/12
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,337,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33612
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F336A1786105098
OL,3,CRiot prisoner took own life after
OL,4,Cbeing reported for racism
OL,6,FThe coroner also said she was
OL,7,F"satisfied" the prison had addressed
OL,8,Fconcerns she raised over the time it
OL,9,Ftook for Mr Lynch's cell to be opened
OL,10,Fwhen he was seen to be unresponsive
OL,11,Fdue to confusion among staff over
OL,12,Femergency procedures.
OL,26,@oD@AOUoD@KO]
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1        G12/12
